---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import { official, site } from '@/data/site';
import { url } from '@/lib/url';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();

const columns: { title: string; links: { label: string; href: string; external?: boolean }[] }[] = [
  {
    title: '제품',
    links: [
      { label: 'Meta Quest 3', href: url('quest.html#quest-3') },
      { label: 'Meta Quest 3S', href: url('quest.html#quest-3s') },
      { label: 'PC VR 연결', href: url('pc-vr.html') },
      { label: '설정 가이드', href: url('setup.html') },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: '둘러보기',
    links: [
      { label: '추천 게임', href: url('games.html') },
      { label: '출시 예정작', href: url('games.html#upcoming') },
      { label: '소개', href: url('oculus.html') },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Meta 공식',
    links: [
      { label: '공식 스토어', href: official.store, external: true },
      { label: '고객 지원', href: official.help, external: true },
      { label: '개발자 센터', href: official.developers, external: true },
      { label: 'YouTube', href: official.youtube, external: true },
    ],
  },
];
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href={url()} aria-label="oculus 홈으로">
          <Logo />
        </a>
        <p>풀 컬러 혼합현실의 Meta Quest 3·3S부터 게임, PC VR, 설정 가이드까지 한곳에서.</p>
      </div>

      <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="사이트맵">
        {columns.map((col) => (
          <div>
            <h2>{col.title}</h2>
            <ul role="list">
              {col.links.map((link) => (
                <li>
                  <a
                    href={link.href}
                    target={link.external ? '_blank' : undefined}
                    rel={link.external ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}
                  >
                    {link.label}
                    {link.external && (
                      <>
                        <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={14} />
                        <span class="sr-only">(새 창)</span>
                      </>
                    )}
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </nav>

      <div class="footer-cta">
        <h2>지금 시작하기</h2>
        <p>Meta Quest 3S $349.99부터 · Meta Quest 3 $599.99 (미국 공식가)</p>
        <a
          class="btn btn--primary btn--sm"
          href={official.store}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Meta 공식 스토어<span class="sr-only">(새 창)</span>
          <Icon name="arrow-up-right" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="fine">
        비공식 팬 사이트로 Meta Platforms, Inc.와 관련이 없습니다. Meta, Meta Quest, Oculus는 Meta
        Platforms, Inc.의 상표입니다. 제품·라이프스타일 사진 일부는 AI로 생성한 연출 이미지이며,
        가격·사양·일정은 {site.verifiedAt} 기준 공개 정보입니다.
      </p>
      <div class="footer-meta">
        <span>
          © {year} {site.author}
        </span>
        <div class="footer-meta__actions">
          <a class="footer-repo" href={site.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <Icon name="github" size={16} />
            GitHub<span class="sr-only">(새 창)</span>
          </a>
          <button class="to-top" type="button" data-to-top>
            <Icon name="arrow-up" size={16} />맨 위로
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-block-start: var(--section);
    padding-block: 4.5rem 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 120% at 85% 0%, rgb(139 92 255 / 0.12), transparent 60%), var(--c-bg-2);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--c-text-2);
  }

  .footer-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1.6fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    max-inline-size: 30ch;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .footer-links li + li {
    margin-block-start: 0.65rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .footer-cta {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.03);
  }

  .footer-cta h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-block-start: 3.5rem;
    padding-block-start: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }

  .footer-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--c-text-3);
  }

  .footer-meta__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-repo,
  .to-top {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    color: var(--c-text-2);
    transition:
      color 0.2s,
      border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-repo:hover,
  .to-top:hover {
    color: var(--c-text);
    border-color: var(--c-border-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .footer-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .footer-links {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      grid-row: 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .footer-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .footer-links {
      grid-row: auto;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
